# skills install writes each skill stamped with this necro's version, replacing an older copy, and links it from .claude/skills, replacing a link that points elsewhere
spec: Skills
args: skills install
-- .agents/skills/necro/SKILL.md --
---
name: necro
description: old
metadata:
  necro-version: "0.0.1"
---
Old.
-- .claude/skills/necro-rules -> ../../elsewhere --
-- @stdout --
necro: installed .agents/skills/necro (necro <version>)
necro: installed .agents/skills/necro-rules (necro <version>)
-- @file .agents/skills/necro/SKILL.md --
---
name: necro
…
metadata:
  necro-version: "<version>"
---
…
-- @file .agents/skills/necro-rules/SKILL.md --
---
name: necro-rules
…
metadata:
  necro-version: "<version>"
---
…
-- @file .claude/skills/necro --
-> ../../.agents/skills/necro
-- @file .claude/skills/necro-rules --
-> ../../.agents/skills/necro-rules
